abstract: >
  HERESY v7.1.0 extends the deterministic HERESY/360 Ada, Fortran, COBOL and POSIX-shell
  stack with an offline Enterprise Reliability Emulator. The module replays a checked-in,
  maintainer-supplied GitHub status-page snapshot from 17 August 2026, preserves source
  text and a compact machine projection behind SHA-256 receipts, validates error-rate
  inputs in Ada, classifies the observed incident deterministically in Fortran, and renders
  the resulting status satire in COBOL. The replay performs no live network lookup and
  explicitly separates supplied status observations from unknown incident root cause.
  The v7.0 deterministic due-process stack remains intact.
